# Mobile Development

## Feature-Based Structure (Required)

```
src/
├── features/
│   ├── auth/
│   │   ├── screens/
│   │   ├── components/
│   │   ├── hooks/
│   │   ├── services/
│   │   └── index.ts
│   ├── dashboard/
│   ├── accounts/
│   └── transfers/
├── shared/
├── navigation/
└── constants/
```

## Styling

- Native StyleSheet.create() only
- No NativeWind or Tailwind
- Design tokens from @/constants

## Navigation

- React Navigation with typed RootStackParamList
- Feature screens in features/[name]/screens/

## Forms

- react-hook-form for all forms
- zod for validation

## Performance

- FlatList for lists (never ScrollView + map)
- useCallback, useMemo, React.memo
- Profile with Flipper

## Security

- Keychain (iOS) / Keystore (Android) for tokens
- Never use AsyncStorage for sensitive data

